sequenceDiagram
    participant Master as Processor (IronCore)
    participant Slave as Memory/Peripheral

    Note over Master, Slave: Read Transaction
    Master->>Slave: CYC=1, STB=1, WE=0, ADR=0x100
    activate Slave
    Slave-->>Master: Wait States (Stall)
    Slave->>Master: ACK=1, DAT_R=0xDATA
    deactivate Slave
    Master->>Slave: CYC=0, STB=0

    Note over Master, Slave: Write Transaction
    Master->>Slave: CYC=1, STB=1, WE=1, ADR=0x200, DAT_W=0x1234
    activate Slave
    Slave-->>Master: Wait States
    Slave->>Master: ACK=1
    deactivate Slave
    Master->>Slave: CYC=0, STB=0
